BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81180\n\nSaturday 21 and Sunday 22 November\nBuses replace trains between Bathurst\, Lithgow and Mount Victoria.\nNSW TrainLink also run coaches between Bathurst and Katoomba that do not require a booking.\nTrains run between Mount Victoria and Central\, some to a changed timetable.\nThe following trains run to a changed timetable between Bathurst and Mount Victoria or Central:\n- 06:07 Bathurst to Central\n- 22:16 Bathurst to Mount Victoria\n- 04:05 Mount Victoria to Bathurst\n- 17:51 Central to Bathurst\nIf travelling to Lithgow to connect with NSW TrainLink Regional Coaches\, call 132 232 to confirm departure times.
DTEND:20261122T125940Z
DTSTART:20261120T150000Z
SUMMARY:Buses replace trains between Bathurst\, Lithgow and Mount Victoria
UID:c143844c-3386-5bc8-9f4a-64e97ae867c9
URL:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81180
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81341\n\nFriday 27 November\nBuses replace trains between Bathurst and Katoomba.\nNSW TrainLink also run coaches between Bathurst and Katoomba that do not require a booking.\nTrains run between Katoomba and Central\, some to a changed timetable.\nLimited morning trains run from Mount Victoria to Central\, leaving Mount Victoria at 02:26AM\, 03:26AM\, 03:56AM\, 04:26AM\, 04:56AM\, 05:18AM and 05:26AM.\nIf travelling to Lithgow to connect with NSW TrainLink Regional Coaches\, call 132 232 to confirm departure times.\nFriday from 9:40PM\, buses replace trains from Blacktown to Lithgow.\nThe last train leaves Central at 20:09PM\, arriving Katoomba at 22:08PM.\nT1 Western Line trains run between Central and Penrith\, to a changed timetable. Change at Blacktown for buses to Blue Mountains Line stations.
DTEND:20261127T150010Z
DTSTART:20261126T150000Z
SUMMARY:Buses replace trains between Bathurst and Katoomba
UID:eec65659-0c40-57eb-8b2d-de16998606fe
URL:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81341
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81337\n\nWednesday 25 November\nBuses replace trains between Bathurst\, Lithgow and Mount Victoria.\nNSW TrainLink also run coaches between Bathurst and Katoomba that do not require a booking.\nTrains run between Mount Victoria and Central\, some to a changed timetable.\nLimited trains run to a changed timetable between Bathurst and Mount Victoria or Central\, in the morning only:\n\n- 05:41 Bathurst to Mount Victoria  \n- 07:39 Bathurst to Central \n- 02:51 Mount Victoria to Bathurst \n- 04:45 Mount Victoria to Bathurst\nFrom 9:30AM Wednesday\, buses replace all trains between Bathurst and Mount Victoria.\nIf travelling to Lithgow to connect with NSW TrainLink Regional Coaches\, call 132 232 to confirm departure times.
