DESCRIPTION:https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-81335\n\nMonday 23 and Tuesday 24 November  \nBuses replace trains between Bathurst\, Lithgow and Mount Victoria. \nNSW TrainLink also run coaches between Bathurst and Katoomba that do not require a booking. \nTrains run between Mount Victoria and Central\, some to a changed timetable. \nLimited trains run between Bathurst and Mount Victoria or Central\, to a changed timetable: \n\nMonday  \n- 05:41 Bathurst to Mount Victoria   \n- 07:39 Bathurst to Central   \n- 19:42 Bathurst to Mount Victoria  \n- 22:11 Bathurst to Mount Victoria  \n- 02:51 Mount Victoria to Bathurst  \n- 04:45 Mount Victoria to Bathurst  \n- 17:25 Mount Victoria to Bathurst   \n- 17:40 Central to Bathurst   \n\nTuesday \n- 05:41 Bathurst to Mount Victoria   \n- 07:39 Bathurst to Central   \n- 19:50 Bathurst to Mount Victoria  \n- 22:19 Bathurst to Mount Victoria  \n- 02:51 Mount Victoria to Bathurst  \n- 04:45 Mount Victoria to Bathurst  \n- 17:25 Mount Victoria to Bathurst   \n- 17:40 Central to Bathurst   \nIf travelling to Lithgow to connect with NSW TrainLink Regional Coaches\, call 132 232 to confirm departure times.
